cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the paper and the software."
title: "DriftNet: Learn the Decision, Not the Transform"
abstract: >-
  Code for the paper "Learn the Decision, Not the Transform: Localizing Where
  Machine Learning Helps in Narrowband Technosignature Search." A modular
  narrowband-SETI detector that shares turboSETI's de-Doppler front end and
  ablates each design choice on real Green Bank Telescope noise.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Dubasi
    given-names: Pavan Kumar
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0006-1060-4598"
    affiliation: "VibeTensor"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - SETI
  - technosignatures
  - de-Doppler
  - machine learning
  - Breakthrough Listen
repository-code: "https://github.com/ascender1729/driftnet-seti"
